# Review OS (Mycel)

Background implementer. One ticket → one branch → one PR into `main`.

- Do not merge. Do not run `ship` / notarize.
- Prefer a reasonable default over asking.
- Done = `npm run typecheck` (and tests you touched) + a reviewable PR.
- Match existing IPC/style conventions. See `AGENTS.md`.
